<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Frozen food</title>

    <!-- Bootstrap -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- CSS -->
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #fff4e8;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #8a4510;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 b {
            color: #f28c28;
        }

        h4 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #9a795e;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: normal;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        hr {
            border-color: #f2c9a5;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        #login {
            max-width: 450px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid #ffe0c2;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            color: #8a4510;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        input[type="email"],
        input[type="Password"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #f5d2b2;
            border-radius: 8px;
            outline: none;
            background-color: #fffaf5;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        input[type="email"]:focus,
        input[type="Password"]:focus {
            border-color: #f28c28;
            box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(242, 140, 40, 0.3);
        }

        input[type="submit"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            background-color: #f28c28;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        input[type="submit"]:hover {
            background-color: #d96d12;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(217, 109, 18, 0.2);
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 25px;
            }

            h4 {
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            #login {
                padding: 25px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1><b>Hi! </b>Selamat Datang di Toko Frozen food.</h1>
    <h4>Sebelum melakukan pemesanan, mohon untuk melakukan registrasi terlebih dahulu dan pastikan bahwa datamu sesuai.</h4><hr><br>
    <div id="login">
        <form>
            <label for="username"> Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="username" name="username" placeholder=" Nama_Akun@gmail.com"><br><br>

            <label for="password">Password</label>
            <input type="Password" id="password" name="password"><br><br>
            
            <label for="kirim">kirim</label>
            <input type="submit" id="kirim" name="kirim">
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
